Production Release Update
26 Aug'2026 | Enhancement Release
Hi team,

We have rolled out a new production release for ClarityPay. Here's a summar=
y of what's included:

________________________________
ENHANCEMENT
CP: Add logo in customer journey for Epic Travelers (JBCA5STT)

Adds the ClarityPay logo to the customer journey for the Epic Travelers mer=
chant, with the correct collapsed and enlarged logo branding across the flo=
w.

ENHANCEMENT
CP: Create a new merchant Epic Travelers in PreProd and Prod

Sets up the new Epic Travelers merchant in the pre-production and productio=
n environments, configured with ClarityPay branding.

ENHANCEMENT
CP - Merchant Portal Revamp

Delivers a centralized Merchant Portal giving merchants control across the =
application lifecycle, including sending prequal and loan-doc links, select=
ing offers, requesting funding and refunds, uploading documents, and managi=
ng users. Includes merchant branding, store selection at loan-doc time, and=
 Talent LMS integration.

ENHANCEMENT
CP: Multiple purchase price support in pricing file and Conduent

Supports multiple buyer purchase prices using a CODE:VALUE;CODE:VALUE forma=
t in the pricing file, with the same string passed through to Conduent. Not=
e: New Conduent Key configuration is planned for next release.

ENHANCEMENT
CP: Preferred Offer concept for Checkout

Introduces the preferred-offer concept for Checkout merchants such as Whop =
and Fanbasis, and for Lead/Invoice API merchants. The application is declin=
ed if the preferred offer cannot be generated; if found, the preferred offe=
rs are attached to the application.

ENHANCEMENT
CP: Pass communication name in email and SMS

Adds a new communication_name variable to email and SMS so individual merch=
ants show the merchant name and aggregator applications show the provider n=
ame, while merchant and provider names continue to be passed separately.

ENHANCEMENT
Lender Dashboard calculation fixes

Moves Lender Dashboard calculations for DTI, offers, program fee, monthly p=
ayment, and post-funding metrics from the frontend to the backend for consi=
stent, accurate results.

________________________________

If you have any questions about this release, please reach out to your acco=
unt manager or contact us at aarzoo.garg@skeps.com<mailto:support@skeps.com=
>.


Regards,
Aarzoo Garg


